<title>JAPAN: Kanematsu to hold briefing on earnings forecast.</title>
<headline>Kanematsu to hold briefing on earnings forecast.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1996-09-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>Kanematsu Corp said on Thursday that it would hold a news conference at 4 p.m. (0700 GMT) on a revision of its earnings forecast.</p>
<p>The trading house gave no further details.</p>
</text>
